      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "image-action",
      "description": "The scoped lightbox action extension, with full-width 44px-minimum buttons and a native exposure range.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-actions\" aria-label=\"Daguerre image editors\"><button class=\"ds-action\">Create layered copy</button><label class=\"ds-exposure\">Exposure · +0.7 EV<input type=\"range\" min=\"-3\" max=\"3\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\"></label><button class=\"ds-action\">Develop copy</button><p class=\"ds-note\">The indexed original stays untouched. The result is saved under Daguerre data.</p><button class=\"ds-action\">Open full editor</button><a class=\"ds-link\" href=\"#project\">Download editable project</a></section>",
      "css": ".ds-actions{padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border,#354243);background:var(--bg-elevated,#1b2425);color:var(--text,#e1ebec);font-family:\"Plus Jakarta Sans Variable\",var(--hoard-font-sans, sans-serif);}.ds-action{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:9px 16px;border-radius:var(--hoard-radius,8px);border:1px solid var(--border,#354243);background:var(--bg-elevated,#1b2425);color:var(--text,#e1ebec);cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px;min-height:36px;font-family:\"Plus Jakarta Sans Variable\",var(--hoard-font-sans, sans-serif);min-height:44px;width:100%;justify-content:center;margin-top:12px}.ds-action:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--hoard-elevated,#242f30);border-color:var(--hoard-border-hover,#57696b);}.ds-action:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#45bccb);outline-offset:1px;}.ds-action:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}.ds-exposure{display:block;margin-top:14px;color:var(--text-muted,#b4bdbe);font-size:12px}.ds-exposure input{display:block;width:100%;margin:8px 0 2px;accent-color:var(--accent,#45bccb)}.ds-note{color:var(--text-muted,#b4bdbe);font-size:12px}.ds-link{background:none;border:none;padding:0;color:var(--accent-dark,#65c7d4);cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}.ds-link:hover{text-decoration:underline}.ds-link:focus-visible{outline:auto}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Local Photo Library",
    "overview": "Daguerre uses a compact photo-library interface: dark teal surfaces by default, an optional light palette, one teal accent and a quiet sans-serif reading voice. Photographs carry the visual weight; the sidebar, thumbnail grid and metadata panel provide continuity around them. This records the incumbent interface rather than introducing a new visual identity.\n\nThe image-editor extension belongs to the existing lightbox. Its copy creation, development, preview, download and full-editor controls use the same buttons, fields and panel surfaces. The complete incorporated desktop editors are separate native egui interfaces; their interfaces remain visually intact apart from Daguerre branding. Their internal tokens are not specified by this browser design system.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Photo-led library with compact navigation and metadata.",
      "Dark teal tonal layers with an optional light-surface theme.",
      "Plus Jakarta Sans for browser reading and controls.",
      "Existing lightbox actions extended with copy creation and result controls."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Source Theme Rule",
        "body": "Resolve colors through the existing theme variables and their final overrides; do not substitute a new palette when extending the library.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Library Rule",
        "body": "Default library cards use tonal layering and borders; preserve the light-theme and photographic shadow exceptions already present.",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Copy Workflow Rule",
        "body": "Keep copy creation, result preview, editable download and full-editor opening explicit, with the indexed original-preservation note beside the actions.",
        "section": "components"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** extend the existing theme, sidebar, grid and lightbox vocabulary.",
      "**Do** preserve the independently scrollable details panel and the image-editor action group's (44px) minimum button height.",
      "**Do** use contained previews for editing results and keep copy/result/editor actions explicit.",
      "**Do** preserve the optional light theme and the native desktop editors' complete incorporated interfaces."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** introduce a new visual world for the image-editor extension.",
      "**Don't** present a created copy as a modification of the indexed original.",
      "**Don't** promote inherited uppercase section labels or unresolved typography/motion findings into rules for new surfaces.",
      "**Don't** interpret the scoped image-action visual review as a universal interface audit or a restyle of native egui editors."
    ]
  }
}
